 to 4 rabbits can embark together.  If you venture out alone, mechanics that normally require cooperation will be replaced with intense bullet hell attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, it isn't always as simple as slapping down the enemies that stand in your way.  Building your character with loot and upgrades you find along the way is key to success.  Certain sets of items combo <i>very</i> well together... so make sure your allies don't roll on something you really need! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132850/extras/f57234600a5f3b0a2568c1e77a51ce39.avif?t=1771398437\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A few months ago, all contact with the Moonlit Kingdom was lost.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Reports indicate that the city's denizens attack outsiders on sight.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Investigative expeditions are repelled or go missing.  </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A colossal white tower now manifests in the city's center each night, stretching skyward towards the stars.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Something must be done.  The rabbits will take care of this. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The night is short.  Move swiftly.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132850/extras/3fda8c416ee4fe1f516517cf8856f361.avif?t=1771398437\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 players can play together locally, online, or a mix of the two</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A plethora of bosses, stages, and challenging bullet-hell patterns to conquer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single player story campaign where you chat up your enemies to uncover the mystery of the Moonlit Kingdom</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 random loot items to power up your character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can kill your friend by clipping them with a &quot;spread&quot; marker for laughs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Honestly they deserve it for rolling on the Darkstorm Knife even though they don't need it and it's SO good for your class</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports playing with keyboard, mouse+keyboard, or with a controller</p></li></ul>","developers":["mino_dev"],"dlc":[2984870,4388270],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132850/header.jpg?t=1771398437","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 mino_dev LLC 2022","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2132850/848947499/bf9e4e63d65f036eb2bb49b7413e8161c47ee486/1770317393/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770396851","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2132850/848947499/bf9e4e63d65f036eb2bb49b7413e8161c47ee486/1770317393/dash_h264.mpd?t=1770396851","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2132850/848947499/bf9e4e63d65f036eb2bb49b7413e8161c47ee486/1770317393/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1770396851","id":257280288,"name":"Rabbit and Steel Extra Mode","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257280288/35d50f9dd2e840463bfa72e4ac7e38a490ad2b66/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1770396851"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2132850/694526/531e7701a0fdd5161d62a4942cc354406a382ddf/1750747396/dash_av1.mpd?t=1714570603","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2132850/694526/531e7701a0fdd5161d62a4942cc354406a382ddf/1750747396/dash_h264.mpd?t=1714